### Register user
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "preferences": ["Ficción", "Ciencia"],
  "annualGoal": 12
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Search books (set env var token)
# After login use the response token value in the authorization header example.
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/search?q=9780262033848
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create book
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isbn": "9780262033848",
  "title": "Design Patterns",
  "authors": ["Erich Gamma", "Richard Helm", "Ralph Johnson", "John Vlissides"],
  "description": "Classic book",
  "thumbnail": "https://example.com/cover.jpg",
  "status": "DESEADO",
  "rating": 5
}

### Update status
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/books/{{bookId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "LEYENDO"
}

### Create loan
POST http://localhost:8080/api/loans
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookId": {{bookId}},
  "contactName": "Amigo",
  "loanDate": "2026-03-26",
  "dueDate": "2026-04-10"
}

### Dashboard
GET http://localhost:8080/api/stats/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
